          "text": "Témoignages: VILLENEUVE-SUR-LOT (47) 21.12.2018",
          "text_sha256": "7f3b85d3c4b50697bf236e792cba8c3463d3b7bc90a8dca3ae6fa6eb51f790cd"
        },
        {
          "end_ms": null,
